            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis feature is already present in 'mini.nvim' via special configs of 'mini.clue'. Here is a [relevant part of help](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee23e1abc206efc6d6cce19ec8c0a3da7a897035/doc/mini-clue.txt#L356-L456). It is not exactly one-to-one to Hydra, but it gets the job done within the design of already present module.\r\n\r\nThere also might be small improvements in the area. Se #1722.\r\n\r\nClosing as already possible with 'mini.clue'.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for the suggestion!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This feature is already present in 'mini.nvim' via special configs of 'mini.clue'. Here is a <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/ee23e1abc206efc6d6cce19ec8c0a3da7a897035/doc/mini-clue.txt#L356-L456\">relevant part of help</a>. It is not exactly one-to-one to Hydra, but it gets the job done within the design of already present module.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There also might be small improvements in the area. Se <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2963956087\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1722\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1722/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1722\">#1722</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Closing as already possible with 'mini.clue'.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Thanks for the suggestion!\nThis feature is already present in 'mini.nvim' via special configs of 'mini.clue'. Here is a relevant part of help. It is not exactly one-to-one to Hydra, but it gets the job done within the design of already present module.\nThere also might be small improvements in the area. Se #1722.\nClosing as already possible with 'mini.clue'.",
